{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 85,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "LORD, you have been favorable to your land. have restored the fortunes of Jacob.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，你已经向你的地施恩， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，你已經向你的地施恩， 。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "You have forgiven the iniquity of your people. You have covered all their sin.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你赦免了你百姓的罪孽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你赦免了你百姓的罪孽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "You have taken away all your wrath. You have turned from the fierceness of your anger.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你收转了所发的忿怒",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你收轉了所發的忿怒",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Turn us, God of our salvation, and cause your indignation toward us to cease.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "拯救我们的 神啊，求你使我们回转，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "拯救我們的上帝啊，求你使我們回轉，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Will you be angry with us forever? Will you draw out your anger to all generations?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你要向我们发怒到永远吗？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你要向我們發怒到永遠嗎？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Won’t you revive us again, that your people may rejoice in you?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你不再将我们救活，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你不再將我們救活，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Show us your loving kindness, LORD. us your salvation.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华啊，求你使我们得见你的慈爱，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華啊，求你使我們得見你的慈愛，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will hear what God, the LORD, will speak, for he will speak peace to his people, his saints; but let them not turn again to folly.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要听 神—耶和华所说的话；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要聽上帝－耶和華所說的話；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "Surely his salvation is near those who fear him, that glory may dwell in our land.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他的救恩诚然与敬畏他的人相近，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他的救恩誠然與敬畏他的人相近，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "Mercy and truth meet together. and peace have kissed each other.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "慈爱和诚实彼此相遇；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "慈愛和誠實彼此相遇；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Truth springs out of the earth. Righteousness has looked down from heaven.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "诚实从地而生；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "誠實從地而生；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "Yes, the LORD will give that which is good. land will yield its increase.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华必将好处赐给； 出土产。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華必將好處賜給； 出土產。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "Righteousness goes before him, and prepares the way for his steps.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "公义要行在他面前， 路。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "公義要行在他面前， 路。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}